{"id":124,"date":"2021-07-31T06:56:04","date_gmt":"2021-07-31T06:56:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/hamza.webfulhost.com\/balancedbms\/?p=124"},"modified":"2025-05-02T06:57:21","modified_gmt":"2025-05-02T06:57:21","slug":"if-you-cant-come-to-us-well-come-to-you","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/if-you-cant-come-to-us-well-come-to-you\/","title":{"rendered":"If you can&#8217;t come to us, we&#8217;ll come to you.."},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-foo\">As you know we are now going into week 5 of lockdown, and most of us are getting a little restless due to these uncertain times.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-f5hno\">I know virtual classes are not for everyone, but unfortunately this is the only option we have right now. If you prefer a group class, like I do, sign up to our zoom classes as this is as close as you will get to a group class. You will be in the company of our teachers, who will<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-9151a\">motivate and guide you through your yoga class.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-52rf6\">Sign up and give it a go !!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-5srct\">Your feedback is important to us.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-e6f0s\">Please let us know what classes you want to take virtually.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-4apmc\">It&#8217;s important that we keep our Yoga practice alive to keep us strong emotionally as well as physically.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-83d2d\">The classes we have available next week:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tuesday YIN 6.00pm ( Joanna )<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Thursday. HATHA 6.15pm ( Evonne )<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Saturday YIN YANG 9.00am ( Rosangela)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Saturday QIGONG 10.30am ( Maria )<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-6d0t3\">Please get in touch if you want to see other classes and times.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-6kb18\">To book a class contact <strong>Evonne<\/strong> on <strong>0406346153<\/strong> or email us at: <strong>info@refreshwellbeing.com.au<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-736pu\">Once you register, we will send you a link to join your class.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-cp2v7\">Stay safe and stay connected \ud83d\ude42<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-271it\">From Evonne and the Refresh Wellbeing Team.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>As you know we are now going into week 5 of lockdown, and most of us are getting a little <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/if-you-cant-come-to-us-well-come-to-you\/\">Read More &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":128,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[5],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-124","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-yoga"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.7 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Yoga Sydney, yoga Marrickville, yoga Beverly Hills, aerial yoga Sydney.<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/if-you-cant-come-to-us-well-come-to-you\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Yoga Sydney, yoga Marrickville, yoga Beverly Hills, aerial yoga Sydney.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"As you know we are now going into week 5 of l